{
  "schema": 2,
  "about": [
    "The target kernel set of a plain decode step of the dense Qwen 3.5-architecture model: per block call of a step the kernel a stack that reproduces the set launches, in step order.",
    "kernels: per kernel id what it is, where it comes from and how it stands to the target -- 'target' of kind 'code' (the target's own compiled kernel: an entry, a library call or a framework operator called as the target calls it) or of kind 'port' (a cuDNN Frontend entry with byte-equal results), or 'stand-in' (a declared replacement for an operation that lives inside a serving engine). 'entry' and 'form' are there once a stack of this repository serves the kernel: the form is what the target passes to the entry.",
    "configurations: per GPU class and SM count one section. 'launch' is [grid, block, shared memory in bytes] of one launch at the section's row count. A section is 'recorded' (launch records of the target on that class) or 'planned' (derived, never claimed); 'claimed' is false until a stack launches every kernel of the section.",
    "The numbers of a section are three, never one: of its launches per step, how many are the target's own compiled kernels (code), how many cuDNN Frontend entries with byte-equal results (port), how many declared stand-ins.",
    "A change of a form this file names changes this file in the same commit."
  ],
  "validated": {
    "recorded": {
      "torch": "2.14.0",
      "triton": "3.8.0",
      "flashinfer-python": "0.7.2.post1",
      "nvidia-cutlass-dsl": "4.8.0",
      "apache-tvm-ffi": "0.1.11"
    }
  },
  "kernels": {
